<!-- https://learn.microsoft.com/dotnet/fundamentals/package-validation/diagnostic-ids
     Intended breaking changes of 5.0.0 against the 4.3.0 baseline:
     - The Roslyn compiler service moved to the package RazorEngine.NetFramework.Roslyn (same namespaces, issue #22).
     - DefaultCompilerServiceFactory compiles with CodeDom again; LanguageVersion is on RoslynCompilerServiceFactory (issue #22).
     - CompilerServiceBuilder and HtmlTemplateBase<T>, obsolete since 4.3.0, are removed.
     - The cross-AppDomain helpers SanboxHelper and CleanupHelper (with SubscribeHelper) are internal, as announced in 4.3.0.
     - The members obsolete since 3.x are removed: TemplateBase/ITemplate.RazorEngine and three DynamicViewBag methods.
     Remove these entries when the baseline moves to 5.0.0. -->
